1
00:00:00,830 --> 00:00:03,530
(Sheldon:)Go east.

2
00:00:03,530 --> 00:00:07,460
"An iron gate blocks your way."

3
00:00:07,470 --> 00:00:10,200
(Sheldon:)Open gate.

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,700
"It's locked."

5
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,870
(Leonard:)Hmm.

6
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:16,040
(Sheldon:)Well, so much for that.

7
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:20,440
(Leonard:)It's getting pretty late.
How come you're still up?

8
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:24,480
I found an emulator online that
lets you play classic text-based

9
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:26,950
(Sheldon:)computer games from the 1980s.

10
00:00:26,950 --> 00:00:28,390
(Leonard:)That's pretty cool.

11
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:31,790
(Sheldon:)Oh, yes. It runs on the world's
most powerful graphics chip:

12
00:00:31,790 --> 00:00:34,060
(Sheldon:)imagination.

13
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:36,860
(Leonard:)You've really got
to get out more.

14
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:40,900
(Sheldon:)Go north.

15
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:43,070
"You can't go that way."

16
00:00:43,070 --> 00:00:44,800
(Sheldon:)Go west.

17
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:47,200
"A troll blocks your passage."

18
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:49,510
(Sheldon:)Okay. Fasten your seatbelts.

19
00:00:50,910 --> 00:00:53,140
(Sheldon:)Kill troll.

20
00:00:53,140 --> 00:00:54,780
"With what?"

21
00:00:54,780 --> 00:00:56,880
(Sheldon:)With sword.

22
00:00:57,880 --> 00:00:59,450
"You don't have the sword."

